npMzMJH1nt_kFkEY85kSLb0IWYpFmJcn03d80oKtPwYhBL16fPXspijqsIkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu8GAaz8yzYN82xoEQ81tWpb_-x3TYKSMCBus2Qauz4pQ&oe=69A41C47"}, {"file_name": "Crossbow_ScreenShot.png", "id": "2397984983893950", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391978_2397984990560616_3969625957978599437_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9a4cOQsMisEQ7kNvwFdwfCd&_nc_oc=AdnZS4v5oEUP0jiOV6vWq43uQKUmwmgzuRKt8tmdH95Ko5uG86bTJFvvLDvcE0d7aBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsXccJnTACaRdoWgP3K4i0FJn0_pJk7xZ-uHQjcITK18A&oe=69A421ED"}, {"file_name": "Olympic_ScreenShot.png", "id": "648582874300164", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392305_648582880966830_2648986520125630881_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nhrZzR2HVfAQ7kNvwGWN30A&_nc_oc=AdnR1CS2gPZIKxDWXvsuSP8a7jCckNgzPvGMzDtz7jRdyQI8yH-bGycmmqT8Ceg-8-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvg0EHOwztumnrB3-pb4MbZgx0VZVsjLuMf8AxfdUULYQ&oe=69A420E1"}, {"file_name": "BallonPop_Screenshot.png", "id": "2053609291789381", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391967_2053609295122714_5342321999149614343_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pYJtfnkjiLAQ7kNvwGJt7HS&_nc_oc=AdkHtqdlpmWGhqJd6l38HfrooJiBA-Ete3CXCoh5vBUVfG9opHvUMdg64V2m1YIPEJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu52T4PNY2BWhhnbjlzG1Cxbu-eION3GImkGkxd6G-OhA&oe=69A433B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLogo_Landscape.png", "id": "616531301220959", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391901_616531307887625_1642505082054004162_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x3eM95WQnaQQ7kNvwEiWfH9&_nc_oc=AdkMpPM7wPjTkhcrPF4tSkzWQmpdfyQCjlzYPXxBh5UoUkWma8AE1LO25_MX3BFMQgk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_ubg5gtH_NwrHczqPzpTy4awsCUzTM2PBaunFx8h9-Q&oe=69A43483"}, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "short_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/varcher-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meatspace Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id"